    "description": {
      "value": "As the manifestation of Dahak was destroyed, a shard of the dragon god's wrathful nature infused you, resulting in a violent temper, strange apocalyptic dreams, an obsession with dragon hunting, or some other touch of his influence.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be in Strength or Charisma, and the other is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Athletics skill and the Dragon Lore skill. You gain the Titan Wrestler skill feat."
